<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4799" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλωή</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλωά</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλέω</span>A, cf. 
			Att.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλως</span>) poet.: <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			<i>threshing-floor,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερὰς κατ᾽ ἀλωάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.499
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεγάλην κατ᾽ ἀλωήν, ἐϋκτιμένῃ
				ἐν ἀλωῇ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				13.588
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				20.496
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				597
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> more
			commonly, <i>any prepared ground</i> (cf. Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.193
			</span></i>), <i>garden, orchard, vineyard,</i> etc., <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.90
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				6.293
			</span></i>, etc.: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ποσειδάωνος ἀ.,</span>
			i.e. sea, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.797
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>halo,</i> of sun or moon, <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				811
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				875
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
